<title>PHILIPPINES: PNB down 7.27 pct on PNB-Republic Bank debt.</title>
<headline>PNB down 7.27 pct on PNB-Republic Bank debt.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Philippine National Bank fell 7.27 percent, or 20 pesos, to 255 pesos at midsession on Thursday on reports it would assume the debts of affiliate PNB-Republic Bank, brokers said.</p>
<p>By mid-session, 114,590 PNB shares were traded.</p>
